# =============================================================
# Netlify _redirects for horowitz.law
# 301 the legacy .html paths to their canonical clean URLs.
#
# The "!" (force) flag is REQUIRED here: with Pretty URLs off,
# the .html files still physically exist, and without the force
# flag Netlify serves the file (200) instead of redirecting.
#
# PORTABILITY NOTE: the "!" force syntax is Netlify-specific.
# At the Cloudflare Pages cutover, review these. Cloudflare reads
# the _redirects format but handles asset-vs-redirect precedence
# differently and does not use the "!" flag.
# =============================================================
/index.html      /            301!
/resume.html     /resume      301!
/colophon.html   /colophon    301!
/opinions.html   /opinions    301!
